# Never send local data, secrets or build output into the image build.
**/data
**/sendora-data
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/.env
**/sendora.env
**/*recovery*
**/*.log
**/*.tmp
**/*.temp
**/~*
**/.DS_Store
**/node_modules
web/dist
.git
.github
# Local tooling state (for example agent worktrees with their own data).
.claude
.idea
.vscode
